{"t":"Chakoyas","s":"chakoyas-cb366","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Toolshaper_Artwork_ef7418.jpg","q":4,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Official chakoyas artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"219\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Toolshaper_Artwork_ef7418.jpg\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Official chakoyas artwork</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Chakoyas are creatures that have been developed in the everlasting winter climate established in <a href=\"#/wiki/Hrodmir\">Hrodmir</a>. Their main settlement is in <a href=\"#/wiki/Hjaern\">Hjaern</a>'s domains. They may seem docile and weak, but they possess great skills in crafting tunnels underground and some even learned how to master elemental forces and if you need rare <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">fish</a> you can go hunt them in a huge amount. They worship the <a href=\"#/wiki/Yeti\">Yetis</a> as divine beings, but bear no relation to them as far as is known.\n</p><p>All Chakoyas are weak to Death Damage and even weaker to Energy Damage.\n</p><p>See also Chakoya NPCs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Chakoyas\">Chakoyas</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Exp\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">HP\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Loot\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Toolshaper\"><img alt=\"Chakoya Toolshaper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Toolshaper_b64052.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Toolshaper\">Chakoya Toolshaper</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">40\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">80\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-20× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a></li>\n<li>Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fireproof%20Horn\">Fireproof Horn</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Bone Shield (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Cube\">Ice Cube</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Mammoth Whopper (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Tribewarden\"><img alt=\"Chakoya Tribewarden\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Tribewarden_b1ced0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Tribewarden\">Chakoya Tribewarden</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">40\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">68\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-20× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Short%20Sword\">Short Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fireproof%20Horn\">Fireproof Horn</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Bone Shield (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Mammoth Whopper (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelemen